<title>USA: Omaha hogs off $1.00-1.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs off $1.00-1.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $1.00 to $1.50 lower. Top $56.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   230-250 lbs    56.00</p>
<p>Sow - not established.</p>
</text>
